@startuml adversarial_framework_new
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Red Agent**\nπ^(r) (fixed)\nMITRE ATT&CK\nConsistent Attacks] as RedAgent #FFE6E6
component [**Environment**\nState S_t\nAttack Surface\nNetwork Updates] as Environment #E6FFE6
component [**Blue Agent**\nπ_θ (PPO)\nAdaptive Policy\nStrategic Decoys] as BlueAgent #E6F3FF

RedAgent --> Environment : Attack Actions
Environment --> BlueAgent : Observations (Obs.)
BlueAgent --> Environment : Defense Actions
Environment --> RedAgent : State Changes (State Δ)
BlueAgent --> Environment : Reward Feedback

note right of BlueAgent : PPO Learning\nPolicy Optimization
note left of RedAgent : Fixed Adversary\nConsistent Behavior

@enduml
